    "updated_at": "2020-06-25T18:30:30Z",
    "body": "I generally preferred the associated-concept style, but I'm not sure it's worth the substantial effort it would take to move. The better cross-linking would be nice indeed, although we could also accomplish that with internal slots.\r\n\r\n> We could also get rid of this note about our \"foreign JavaScript specification conventions\". 🙂\r\n\r\nThe use of completion values, with ?/!, would remain.",
